        "heading_raw": "Prerequisites",
        "body_raw": "Amateur GunslingerUC feat or grit class feature, Dazzling Display, Weapon Focus."
      },
      {
        "heading_raw": "Benefit",
        "body_raw": "You can spend 1 grit point to make a feint attempt using a one-handed firearm for which you have Weapon Focus (instead of a melee weapon). The target of this feint must be within 30 feet of you and be able to see you. If you have the Quick Draw feat, you can holster a onehanded firearm as a free action as long as you have at least 1 grit point."
      }
